-   Scale the points by dividing by $s$:
-   $$
-   p''_i = \frac{p'_i}{s}
-   $$
-   Translate the coordinates by adding 0.5 to center the object in the $[0.5, 1.5]$ range:
-   $$
-   p_{final, i} = p''_i + 0.5
-   $$
-   This effectively maps the bounding box to $[0, 1]$ and shifts it [S1, unofficial].
